{"name":"Child of Heaven","hex":"#eae5c5","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"child","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who has not yet reached adulthood, whether natural (puberty), cultural (initiation), or legal (majority).","A youth aged 1 to 9 years, whereas neonates are aged 0 to 1 month, infants are aged 1 to 12 months, and adolescents are aged 10 to 20 years."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To give birth; to beget or procreate."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/child"},{"term":"heaven","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The sky, specifically:\n The distant sky in which the sun, moon, and stars appear or move; the firmament; the celestial spheres.\n\n The near sky in which weather, flying animals, etc. appear;  the atmosphere; the climate.\n\n A model displaying the movement of the celestial bodies, an orrery.","The distant sky in which the sun, moon, and stars appear or move; the firmament; the celestial spheres."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To transport to the abode of God, the gods, or the blessed.","To beatify, enchant, or please greatly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/heaven"}],"entries":[{"title":"Seven Samurai 20XX","blocks":[{"text":"Seven Samurai 20XX  is a PlayStation 2 game released by Sammy Studios in 2004. Its story and concept are based upon Akira Kurosawa's 1954 movie Seven Samurai. Rights for the production of the game were given by the Kurosawa production, with character designs by French artist Mœbius and the composition of the opening and ending music by Ryuichi Sakamoto."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/18/Sevensamuraibox.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seven_Samurai_20XX"},{"title":"Child","blocks":[{"text":"A child is a human being between the stages of birth and puberty, or between the developmental period of infancy and puberty. The term may also refer to an unborn human being. In English-speaking countries, the legal definition of child generally refers to a minor, in this case as a person younger than the local age of majority, regardless of their physical, mental and sexual development as biological adults. Children generally have fewer rights and responsibilities than adults. They are generally classed as unable to make serious decisions."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/International_children_dressed_in_their_native_costumes_participate_in_the_100th_anniversary_of_the_Statue_of_Liberty_-_DPLA_-_4461efafd5c4ba7fde8eedb1f13f439e.jpeg/330px-thumbnail.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Child"},{"title":"Heaven","blocks":[{"text":"Heaven, or the Heavens, is a common religious cosmological or supernatural place where beings such as deities, angels, souls, saints, or venerated ancestors are said to originate, be enthroned, or reside. According to the beliefs of some religions, heavenly beings can descend to Earth or incarnate and earthly beings can ascend to Heaven in the afterlife or, in exceptional cases, enter Heaven without dying."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Paradiso_Canto_31_%28148200393%29.jpg/330px-Paradiso_Canto_31_%28148200393%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heaven"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/56/SS20XX13.jpg/330px-SS20XX13.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/56/SS20XX13.jpg/330px-SS20XX13.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Natoe uses Nitou-Ryu mode (twin swords) on a gang of thugs, currently at a 6-hit combo multiper.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASS20XX13.